<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks persist in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks reported in Trang. Security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. Thailand is introducing digital border passes to shorten queues at the Mae Sai crossing, while the central banks of Singapore, Malaysia and Thailand have joined the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative, expanding stablecoin payments across the three countries. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOVGNkVjIzZzhzeExQNEtQbF8walk2Y19SSTRaZFgtOGcxZVhCbWxBMGtSUmJ1d1ZlYnVCTU15X0JOQ2V6OHF3THRkTjBLbjRZdDA4VzBsdWFLVTBkZE1sczdFNUhQSUZ5MW03cng1cl9IVTZqcEdUNUJFQURnd2VCWjRkZzlXNDFyazRfZzRZNzVacjJUdW0tNUYzWU1xYklwR3RCb1RIRjVmZEF4TUNSRFlFVlVWYkJwQTIxZ3g5RHhVbDJrbUZWZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPdEZhYTRjYjNDYnl1QXdHQ09sWUtfaW4zd3c2d0JvS21mVl9RbEdDOE5LQU4yRmFJMlJSVElPLXlsMlI5UmpOSm15bzhRUVlZM3dkcTI3STc5Y3VQc09xazNpeHdTSEZDRGNQcGlMcUQ1ZXFYXzRFSHFHWXBqWUl2NFdGemk0WU1fcmRsY2ZHekpXdE9VMGh3YW44Ymx1emhWbmJEak96QS1ucGhrdWVXakUxVlNndjdVZUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPdENIUFpSemhHUkVTUEl0aEV4QzVpLXAzaHFlRFVxM3ktNUVLNDIzNXVSeThIRkZ6ODlLbEk2bldsNWl3THFUR0p0dktwcEpXZ21NT2hiUkczN2hZODVFVlJHVFZGa3NGLWZ4akx1OHoyM0tDRU1EZ3ZJbWdPanlydzhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hokanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFA2U05GakJ5SUFTXy1uNFUwMFBXTXg0YjZqTFV0bFpNdHdzNXNQbnFPbEhmWnIzUUVKbGgtbGt1X1FNQXZhNkJXRmZ5cHdncWRxRS1OT3hR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht